{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §5.4, [TSON-SCHEMA] §7.2 (inline types, proposed for Revision 40)"
  description: """
    A choice written in place has no name for a tag to give, but its variants may: a tag at it still names a
    declared variant, so `!order` selects `order`.
    """
  valid: _
}
